# Force these as binary so git never runs line-ending/text conversion on
# them (autocrlf, safecrlf, or diff filters) - a single mangled byte in a
# PNG/JPEG is exactly the kind of thing that shows up much later as an
# obscure "AAPT: error: file failed to compile" in an Android build.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.svg binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.db binary
